name: simSetPluginInfo
description: Attaches additional information to a loaded plugin
luaSynopsis: sim.setPluginInfo(string pluginName, int infoType, string/int info)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setPluginInfo(string pluginName, int infoType, string/int info)
inputs:
1. pluginName: name of the plugin. See sim.getPluginName
2. infoType: the type of information to set
3. info: string or integer information value
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: setPluginInfo, class: app, file: app_setPluginInfo.method
